WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.983
Step 1. Open the schedule.

1.2
00:00:01.983 --> 00:00:05.981
Exceptions are periods when a practitioner is not available,

1.3
00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:08.380
across all their schedule templates.

1.4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:13.211
Open the account menu, select Profile, then the Availability tab.

2.1
00:00:13.211 --> 00:00:17.630
Step 2. Open the Exceptions tab. Select the Exceptions tab.

2.2
00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.662
Anyone who can open the schedule page can open it.

3.1
00:00:21.662 --> 00:00:24.489
Step 3. Read the list of exceptions.

3.2
00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:29.714
The tab lists only the exceptions that overlap the month on the calendar.

3.3
00:00:29.714 --> 00:00:33.579
Each shows its reason, its times and its dates.

4.1
00:00:33.579 --> 00:00:38.397
Step 4. Check the calendar. Days with an exception have stripes.

4.2
00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:42.680
Select a day to see its exceptions, each shown as Exception,

4.3
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.322
with its reason and its times.
